  "releaseNotes": "v4.9.4 stable: closes `P2PSwarm.TwoTab_PeerDiscovery` regression. `P2PWebRtcBridge.wire.OnClose` now filters phantom-alive wires (where `Destroyed=false` but underlying transport is dead) using the new `Wire.SimplePeer.IsTransportDead` accessor in SpawnDev.WebTorrent 3.2.3 stable. Both bridge filter sites updated: the wireSet `RemoveWhere` and the `torrent.Wires` cross-check walk. Catches the Chromium-under-Playwright bug where `connectionstatechange` doesn't propagate to `\"failed\"` on remote tab close. Verified: TwoTab passes 1m 37s standalone (was failing 90s timeout in 4.9.2-rc.34); LargeBuffer_100MB passes 3m 37s standalone (no regression). Stable rollup of 4.9.4-rc.1 + rc.2. SpawnDev.WebTorrent dep bumped 3.2.2 -> 3.2.3 stable.",
